OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy and mostly dull start
OL,6,Fwith a few spots of rain. Turning
OL,7,Fdrier and brighter by the afternoon
OL,8,Fwith hazy sunny intervals and largely
OL,9,Fdry. Feeling pleasant in the sunshine
OL,10,Fwith a breeze, especially developing
OL,11,Falong the coast.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FBecoming cloudier through
OL,14,Fthis evening with a band of rain
OL,15,Fpushing through overnight, clearing
OL,16,Fmost places by dawn. Breezy and
OL,17,Ffeeling less mild.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
FL,171,160,301,260,100,100
