OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FAny early rain clearing,
OL,6,Fleaving a mixture of sunny spells and
OL,7,Fscattered showers. These turning heavy
OL,8,Fat times with the risk of thunder and
OL,9,Fhail. Feeling fresher.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,12,FStayed mixed during Thursday and
OL,13,FFriday with slow-moving heavy
OL,14,Fdownpours with the chance of thunder.
OL,15,FMore settled through Saturday with
OL,16,Fsunny spells and the odd shower.
OL,17,FTemperatures around average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
